Package: fathom-server
Architecture: all
Pre-Depends: adduser
Depends:
 ca-certificates,
 python3 (>= 3.11),
 python3-venv,
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Fathom documentation deployment server
 Fathom is a server for receiving documentation deployments and publishing
 them to managed filesystem locations.
 .
 This Debian meta-package bundles the Fathom base and server wheels, installs
 them and their third-party Python dependencies in a private virtual
 environment, and never modifies Debian's system Python environment.
